      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow5:247",
        "answer": "Builds CoD.TabbedScoreboardMapInfoboxLeft from the supplied eight layout bounds; f1_arg0 is the menu and f1_arg1 the controller. Creates/adds/publishes children in source order: InfoLeftBarBot, InfoLeftBGBlur, InfoLeftBG, InfoLeftBarRed, InfoLeftBarRedAdd, InfoLeftBarTop, TerminalNumber, VisibilityTextBlur, VisibilityText, FuiElements, infoLeftText. Exact eager setup, property/asset values, each owned callback, guard and return are retained in the ordered source trace.  Calls the shown optional load hook at its exact source position, then returns self. Child/base/provider lifetime and callback invocation remain conditional.",
        "unknowns": [
